        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Severance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Severance is a 1–5 player co-op paranormal investigation game, with a twist...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Y<strong>OU can become the ghost.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Severance</strong> is a 1–5 player, online co-op, tactical horror game. You and your team of investigators enter haunted locations to track and identify <strong>20+ unique ghost types</strong> using professional paranormal equipment. Use tools like EMF Meters, Video Cameras and Possession Dolls to gather evidence and spot specific behavioral &quot;tells.&quot; Whether facing a brutal AI or a <strong>player-controlled ghost</strong> in Asymmetrical mode, you must use your learned skills to solve the mystery before the hunt begins. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how you play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a <strong>smart Ghost AI</strong> designed to stalk, scare, and hunt investigators.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or enter the<strong> Ghost Player Mode</strong>, where you hunt as the ghost against your investigating friends</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧟 Ghost Player Mode (Asymmetrical)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ghost Player mode, <strong>one player becomes the ghost</strong>.<br>Interact with the map, scare investigators, lock doors, throw objects, and plan hunts strategically. Outplay the team by managing sanity, timing hunts, and creating fear before striking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815750/extras/7d6d1b9e20e17b2af7fd535bf84e34d5.poster.avif?t=1789227822\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815750/extras/7d6d1b9e20e17b2af7fd535bf84e34d5.webm?t=1789227822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815750/extras/7d6d1b9e20e17b2af7fd535bf84e34d5.mp4?t=1789227822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👻 Ghost AI Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ghost AI mode, the entity is controlled by an advanced AI that actively observes investigators, reacts to their actions, and builds pressure over time.<br>It uses the environment, drains sanity, and hunts when the moment is right, creating tense, unpredictable investigations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔎 Play as the Investigator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use classic paranormal equipment to gather real evidence and identify the ghost type.<br>Be aware, the ghost sees and hears you. Every scare, interaction, or mistake can become valuable evidence if you stay calm under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815750/extras/d181ffb2c6132dfe89f1295cc6e8e8e4.poster.avif?t=1789227822\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815750/extras/d181ffb2c6132dfe89f1295cc6e8e8e4.webm?t=1789227822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815750/extras/d181ffb2c6132dfe89f1295cc6e8e8e4.mp4?t=1789227822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎧 Immersive Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Severance features realistic visuals, environmental audio, and a minimal UI for full immersion.<br>Every sound, shadow, and flicker could be a clue… or a warning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠 Signature Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with classic paranormal tools like EMF meters and thermometers, alongside unique devices such as possession dolls to track and provoke the entity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤝 True Co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success relies on teamwork. Share evidence, communicate clearly, and watch each other’s backs, because whether it’s AI or a real player, the ghost is always listening. </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Severance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Severance is a 1–5 player co-op paranormal investigation game, with a twist...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Y<strong>OU can become the ghost.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Severance</strong> is a 1–5 player, online co-op, tactical horror game. You and your team of investigators enter haunted locations to track and identify <strong>20+ unique ghost types</strong> using professional paranormal equipment. Use tools like EMF Meters, Video Cameras and Possession Dolls to gather evidence and spot specific behavioral &quot;tells.&quot; Whether facing a brutal AI or a <strong>player-controlled ghost</strong> in Asymmetrical mode, you must use your learned skills to solve the mystery before the hunt begins. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how you play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a <strong>smart Ghost AI</strong> designed to stalk, scare, and hunt investigators.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or enter the<strong> Ghost Player Mode</strong>, where you hunt as the ghost against your investigating friends</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧟 Ghost Player Mode (Asymmetrical)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ghost Player mode, <strong>one player becomes the ghost</strong>.<br>Interact with the map, scare investigators, lock doors, throw objects, and plan hunts strategically. Outplay the team by managing sanity, timing hunts, and creating fear before striking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815750/extras/7d6d1b9e20e17b2af7fd535bf84e34d5.poster.avif?t=1789227822\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815750/extras/7d6d1b9e20e17b2af7fd535bf84e34d5.webm?t=1789227822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815750/extras/7d6d1b9e20e17b2af7fd535bf84e34d5.mp4?t=1789227822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👻 Ghost AI Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ghost AI mode, the entity is controlled by an advanced AI that actively observes investigators, reacts to their actions, and builds pressure over time.<br>It uses the environment, drains sanity, and hunts when the moment is right, creating tense, unpredictable investigations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔎 Play as the Investigator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use classic paranormal equipment to gather real evidence and identify the ghost type.<br>Be aware, the ghost sees and hears you. Every scare, interaction, or mistake can become valuable evidence if you stay calm under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815750/extras/d181ffb2c6132dfe89f1295cc6e8e8e4.poster.avif?t=1789227822\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815750/extras/d181ffb2c6132dfe89f1295cc6e8e8e4.webm?t=1789227822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815750/extras/d181ffb2c6132dfe89f1295cc6e8e8e4.mp4?t=1789227822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎧 Immersive Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Severance features realistic visuals, environmental audio, and a minimal UI for full immersion.<br>Every sound, shadow, and flicker could be a clue… or a warning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠 Signature Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with classic paranormal tools like EMF meters and thermometers, alongside unique devices such as possession dolls to track and provoke the entity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤝 True Co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success relies on teamwork. Share evidence, communicate clearly, and watch each other’s backs, because whether it’s AI or a real player, the ghost is always listening. </p>",
